* {{l|is|matarborð}}
* {{l|is|matarboð}}
* {{l|is|mjólkurmatur}}
* {{l|is|gera sér mat úr}} (to cash in on)
* {{l|is|herramannsmatur}}
* {{l|is|í matinn}}

